    {
      "id": "jingzhe-c1",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "二十四节气按太阳位置划分一年，每段15°。节气是太阳的刻度，不是天气预报。",
        "en": "The 24 solar terms divide the year by the Sun's position. They are a solar calendar, not weather forecasts."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国"
      ],
      "period": "现行口径（GB/T 33661-2017 时代）；机制承自传统历法",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-hko-solar-terms"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-calendar-role"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "jingzhe-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "惊蛰是第三个节气。太阳到达黄经345°，在公历3月5日前后。春雷始鸣，冬眠的虫子被唤醒。",
        "en": "Jingzhe is the third term: the Sun reaches 345°, around March 5. Spring thunder awakens hibernating creatures."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-jingzhe-feature",
        "source-xinhua-jingzhe-2022"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-jingzhe-longitude-345"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "jingzhe-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "惊蛰是农历二月的\"节\"。在传统历法中，它与春分配对，一节一中气。",
        "en": "Jingzhe is the \"node term\" of the second lunar month, paired with the Spring Equinox."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
