    {
      "id": "jingzhe-c5",
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "古人观察到的三候：桃花开了、黄鹂叫了、鹰变成鸠。这是古典记录，不是科学观测。",
        "en": "Ancient texts record: peach blossoms open, orioles sing, hawks become doves. Classical observation, not modern science."
      },
      "region": [
